WEBVTT

00:08:29.850 --> 00:08:32.530
En die C se taak is om
die B treurig te maak.

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:34.060
En dit werk, of hoe?

00:08:34.060 --> 00:08:35.600
(Gelag)

00:08:35.600 --> 00:08:36.710
Komponiste weet dit.

00:08:36.710 --> 00:08:39.770
As hulle treurige musiek wil hê,
speel hulle net dié twee note.

00:08:39.770 --> 00:08:43.320
(Musiek)

00:08:43.320 --> 00:08:46.350
Maar basies is dit net ’n B,
met vier treuriges.

00:08:46.350 --> 00:08:47.380
(Gelag)

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:51.040
Nou gaan dit af na A.

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:52.550
Nou na G.

00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:53.780
En dan na F.

00:08:53.780 --> 00:08:56.300
So ons het B, A, G, F.

00:08:56.300 --> 00:08:58.200
En as ons B, A, G, F het,

00:08:58.200 --> 00:09:00.120
wat verwag ons volgende?